('Level8_2','Level8_2_1698','chopsticks','''tʃɑp,stɪks','''tʃɒpstɪks','[n] 筷子','We still lack a pair of chopsticks.  还少一双筷子。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_1699','choral','''kɔrəl','''kɔːr(ə)l','[adj] 合唱的；合唱队的; [n] 赞美诗；唱诗班','an evening of choral music  合唱音乐晚会'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_1700','chord','kɔrd','kɔːd','[n] 弦；和弦；香水的基调','Many of the things she says will strike a chord with other young women.  她说的许多话都能引起其他年轻女子的共鸣。'),
