('Level8_2','Level8_2_4474','fortuitous','fɔr''tuɪtəs','fɔː''tjuːɪtəs','[adj] 偶然的，意外的；幸运的','The meeting with Jack was fortuitous.  遇到杰克是机缘巧合。'),
