('Level8_2','Level8_2_5086','harmless','''hɑrmləs','''hɑ:mləs','[adj] 无害的；无恶意的','Her brother’s a bit simple, but he’s quite harmless.  她的弟弟有点愚钝，不过他决不会伤害别人。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_5087','harmonica','hɑr''mɑnɪkə','hɑː''mɒnɪkə','[n] 口琴（等于mouth organ）','Usually Gus would bring his harmonica and, after talking for a little while, they’d play a few songs together.  通常盖斯会带着他的口琴，在聊了一会儿以后，他们会一起演奏几首歌。'),
