('Level8_2','Level8_2_5093','harpoon','hɑr''pun','hɑː''puːn','[v] 用鱼叉叉；用鱼叉捕获; [n] 鱼叉','Norwegian whalers said yesterday they had harpooned a female minke whale.  挪威的捕鲸人昨天说他们用捕鲸叉捕获了一头雌性小须鲸。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_5094','harrow','','''hærəʊ','[n] 耙; [v] 耙地；使苦恼','Canst thou bind the unicorn with his band in the furrow? or will he harrow the valleys after thee?  你岂能用套绳将野牛笼在犁沟之间。 它岂肯随你耙山谷之地。'),
