('Level8_2','Level8_2_5151','headstrong','''hɛdstrɔŋ','''hedstrɒŋ','[adj] 任性的；顽固的；刚愎的','He''s young, very headstrong, but he''s a good man underneath.  他年轻、任性，但骨子里是个好人。'),
