('Level8_2','Level8_2_5162','hearse','hɝs','hɜːs','[n] 灵车；棺材','Father Fauchelevent, we must come to a decision: I must either be caught here, or accept this escape through the hearse.  割风爷，得拿定主意了：或是在这里等人家来捉，或是接受由灵车带出去的办法。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_5163','heart','hɑrt','hɑːt','[n] 心脏；感情；勇气；心形；要点; [vt] 鼓励；铭记; [vi] 结心','Regular exercise is good for the heart.  经常锻炼对心脏有好处。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_5164','heartache','''hɑrtek','''hɑːteɪk','[n] 心痛；悲叹','...after suffering the heartache of her divorce from her first husband.  …经历了与第一任丈夫离婚的心痛之后。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_5165','heartbeat','''hɑrtbit','''hɑːtbiːt','[n] 心跳；情感','Your baby''s heartbeat will be monitored continuously.  您小宝宝的心跳将会受到持续监听。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_5166','heartbreak','''hɑrtbrek','''hɑːtbreɪk','[n] 心碎；伤心事','...suffering and heartbreak for those close to the victims.  …那些受害者亲人的痛苦与悲伤。'),
