('Level8_2','Level8_2_5168','heartbroken','''hɑrtbrokən','''hɑːtbrəʊkən','[adj] 悲伤的，伤心的','Was your daddy heartbroken when they got a divorce?  他们离婚时你爸爸很伤心吗？'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_5169','hearten','''hɑrtn','''hɑːt(ə)n','[v] 激励；鼓励；使振作','The news heartened everybody.  这个消息鼓舞了每个人。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_5170','heartfelt','''hɑrtfɛlt','''hɑːtfelt','[adj] 衷心的；真诚的；真心真意的','a heartfelt apology  真诚的道歉'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_5171','hearth','hɑrθ','hɑːθ','[n] 灶台；炉边；炉床；壁炉地面','It was winter and there was a huge fire roaring in the hearth.  时值冬天，壁炉里的炉火在熊熊燃烧。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_5172','heartily','''hɑrtɪli','''hɑːtɪlɪ','[adv] 衷心地；热忱地；痛快地','This is a book I heartily recommend to all hill walkers.  我向所有山区健行者大力推荐这本书。'),
