('Level8_2','Level8_2_5204','heifer','''hɛfɚ','''hefə','[n] 小母牛','When we first meet Sylvester Stallone in that film, he frankly looks like a skinned heifer that someone left out in the rain for six weeks.  影片开头，我们看看西尔维斯特·史泰龙，简直就象一头被扒了皮的小母牛，而且，还被人扔在雨里，放了六星期。'),
