('Level8_2','Level8_2_5239','herbivore','ɝ​bəˌvɔr','''hɜːbɪvɔː','[n] [动] 食草动物','The meat of the herbivore is, in comparison, far more edible , smellwise.  相对地，食草动物的肉闻起来要好些，更易食用。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_5240','herbivorous','''hɝbɪvərəs','hɜː''bɪvərəs','[adj] [动] 食草的','" Cornett''s attorney, Jack Johnston, said the tooth "looks like it would be from a herbivorous rodent of some type.  科内特的律师杰克·约翰斯顿说，这颗牙“看起来像是某种食草的啮齿类动物的牙。”'),
