('Level8_2','Level8_2_6152','inundate','''ɪnʌndet','''ɪnʌndeɪt','[v] 淹没；泛滥；浸水；（洪水般的）扑来','The tidal wave inundated vast areas of cropland.  海啸淹没了大片农田。'),
