('Level8_2','Level8_2_6162','inventive','ɪn''vɛntɪv','ɪn''ventɪv','[adj] 发明的；有发明才能的；独出心裁的','It inspired me to be more inventive with my own cooking.  它激励我在自己烹饪时更具创造力。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_6163','inventor','ɪn''vɛntɚ','ɪn''ventə','[n] 发明家；[专利] 发明人；创造者','...Alexander Graham Bell, the inventor of the telephone.  …亚历山大·格雷厄姆·贝尔，电话的发明者。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_6164','inventory','''ɪnvəntɔri','''ɪnv(ə)nt(ə)rɪ','[n] 存货，存货清单；详细目录；财产清册','...one inventory of twelve sails for each yacht.  …为每艘游艇配备12张帆的存货。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_6165','inverse',',ɪn''vɝs','''ɪnvɜːs; ɪn''vɜːs','[n] 相反；倒转; [adj] 相反的；倒转的; [vt] 使倒转；使颠倒','Clearly, the amount of money people save increases in inverse proportion to the amount they spend.  显然，人们储蓄的增加与消费成反比。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_6166','invert','''ɪnvɝt','ɪn''vɜːt','[v] 使…转化；使…颠倒；使…反转；使…前后倒置; [n] 颠倒的事物；倒置物；倒悬者; [adj] 转化的','Invert the cake onto a serving plate.  把蛋糕倒扣过来放到一个盘子上。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_6167','invest','ɪn''vɛst','ɪn''vest','[v] 投资；覆盖；耗费；授予；包围','I’ve got a few thousand dollars I’m looking to invest.  我有几千美元想作投资。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_6168','investigate','ɪn''vɛstɪɡet','ɪn''vestɪgeɪt','[v] 调查；研究','The state police are investigating the incident.  州警察正调查此事。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_6169','investigation','ɪn,vɛstɪ''ɡeʃən','ɪn,vestɪ''geɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 调查；调查研究','The investigation continued for nearly three years.  调查持续了近三年。'),
