('Level8_2','Level8_2_6171','investment','ɪn''vɛstmənt','ɪn''ves(t)m(ə)nt','[n] 投资；投入；封锁','We plan to buy some property as an investment.  我们打算买些房地产作为投资。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_6172','investor','ɪn''vɛstɚ','ɪn''vestə','[n] 投资者','The main investor in the project is the French bank Credit National.  该项目的主要投资方是法国国民信贷银行。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_6173','inveterate','ɪn''vɛtərət','ɪn''vet(ə)rət','[adj] 根深的；积习的；成癖的','...an inveterate gambler.  ...一个恶心成瘾的赌徒。'),
