('Level8_2','Level8_2_6201','ironic','aɪ''rɑnɪk','aɪ''rɒnɪk','[adj] 讽刺的；反话的','Your car was stolen at the police station! How ironic!  你的车在警察局被偷！真让人哭笑不得！'),
