('Level8_2','Level8_2_8270','population',',pɑpju''leʃən','pɒpjʊ''leɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 人口；[生物] 种群，[生物] 群体；全体居民','Nearly 70 percent of the population still live in the countryside.  人口中差不多有70%仍住在乡村。'),
