('Level8_2','Level8_2_9186','revival','rɪ''vaɪvl','rɪ''vaɪv(ə)l','[n] 复兴；复活；苏醒；恢复精神；再生效','The US and the UK have expectations of economic revival.  美国和英国对经济复苏有所期待。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_9187','revive','rɪ''vaɪv','rɪ''vaɪv','[v] 复兴；复活；苏醒；恢复精神','Local people have decided to revive this centuries-old tradition.  当地人决定复兴这一延续了数个世纪的传统。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_9188','revivify','ri:''vivifai','rɪ''vɪvɪfaɪ','[v] 使再生，使复活；使振奋精神','The aim was to strengthen and revivify the Labour Party.  目的是要让工党强盛起来，恢复活力。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_9189','revoke','rɪ''vok','rɪ''vəʊk','[v] 撤回，取消；废除; [n] 有牌不跟','Their work permits have been revoked.  他们的工作许可证被吊销了。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_9190','revolt','rɪ''volt','rɪ''vəʊlt','[v] 反抗；反叛；反感，厌恶; [n] 反抗；叛乱；反感','He was revolted by the smell.  那气味让他恶心。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_9191','revolution','''rɛvə''lʊʃən','revə''luːʃ(ə)n','[n] 革命；旋转；运行；循环','the French Revolution of 1789  1789年法国大革命'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_9192','revolutionary','''rɛvə''lʊʃə''nɛri','revə''luːʃ(ə)n(ə)rɪ','[adj] 革命的；旋转的；大变革的; [n] 革命者','The new cancer drug is a revolutionary breakthrough.  这种抗癌新药是一个革命性突破。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_9193','revolve','rɪ''vɔlv','rɪ''vɒlv','[v] 旋转；循环出现；反复考虑; [n] 旋转；循环；旋转舞台','The wheel began to revolve.  轮子开始旋转。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_9194','revolver','rɪ''vɑlvɚ','rɪ''vɒlvə','[n] 左轮手枪；旋转器','The revolver was loaded with only one bullet.  这支左轮手枪仅上了一颗子弹。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_9195','revulsion','rɪ''vʌlʃən','rɪ''vʌlʃ(ə)n','[n] 剧变；厌恶；强烈反感；抽回','News of the atrocities produced a wave of anger and revulsion.  对于暴行的报道激起了愤怒和憎恶的浪潮。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_9196','reward','rɪ''wɔrd','rɪ''wɔːd','[n] [劳经] 报酬；报答；酬谢; [v] [劳经] 奖励；奖赏','The school has a system of rewards and punishments to encourage good behaviour.  学校有奖惩制度以鼓励良好行为。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_9197','rewrite','''riraɪt','riː''raɪt','[v] 改写；重写; [n] 重写或改写的文稿；改写的作品','I’ll have to rewrite most of the essay.  这篇论文大部分我都得重写。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_9198','rhetoric','''rɛtərɪk','''retərɪk','[n] 修辞，修辞学；华丽的词藻; [adj] 花言巧语的','The speech was dismissed by some people as merely political rhetoric .  有些人认为这场演讲只是华而不实的政治空谈。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_9199','rhetorical','rɪ''tɔrɪkl','rɪ''tɒrɪk(ə)l','[adj] 修辞的；修辞学的；夸张的','a speech full of rhetorical phrases  充满华丽辞藻的演讲'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_9200','rheumatism','''rumətɪzəm','''ruːmətɪz(ə)m','[n] [内科] 风湿病','Due to the harsh environment, at least one person in each household suffers from diseases like rheumatism, stomach complaint and gynecological disease.  恶劣的生活环境导致了每个家庭都有成员存在不同程度的疾病。 风湿病、胃病、妇科病常伴着他们。'),
