('Level8_2','Level8_2_10732','suspender','sə''spɛndɚ','','[n] 袜吊；吊裤带；悬挂物','He also wore a pair of suspenders.  他也穿着吊带裤。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_10733','suspenders','sə''spɛndɚz','sə''spendəz','[n] 吊裤带；裤子背带（suspender的复数）','He also wore a pair of suspenders.  他也穿着吊带裤。'),
