('Level8_2','Level8_2_11722','venerable','''vɛnərəbl','''ven(ə)rəb(ə)l','[adj] 庄严的，值得尊敬的；珍贵的','Her Chinese friends referred to the empress as their venerable ancestor.  她的中国朋友们称那位皇后是令他们尊敬的祖先。'),
