('Level8_2','Level8_2_11734','ventral','''vɛntrəl','''ventr(ə)l','[adj] 腹侧的；[解剖] 腹部的; [n] 腹鳍','Its ventral fins are orange.  它的腹鳍为橙色。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_11735','ventricle','''vɛntrɪkl','''ventrɪk(ə)l','[n] 室；心室；脑室','So when the atria contract, the valves sandwiched between the atria and the ventricles open, and the blood in each atrium flows through its respective valve down into a ventricle.  所以当你的心房收缩时，夹在心房和心室之间的阀门就打开了，然后每个心房里的血液通过各自的阀门流向心室。'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_11736','ventricular','vɛn''trɪkjəlɚ','ven''trɪkjʊlə','[adj] 心室的；脑室的；膨胀的；腹部的',''),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_11737','venture','''vɛntʃɚ','''ventʃə','[v] 敢于; [n] 企业；风险；冒险','...a Russian-American joint venture.  …一个俄美合资的风险项目。'),
