('Level8_2','Level8_2_11746','verge','vɝdʒ','vɜːdʒ','[v] 濒临，接近；处在边缘; [n] 边缘','to verge on chaos'),
('Level8_2','Level8_2_11747','verify','''vɛrɪfaɪ','''verɪfaɪ','[v] 核实；查证','American forces will remain to verify compliance with the treaty.  美军将继续驻留，核查条约是否得到遵守。'),
