('PEPGaoZhong_8','PEPGaoZhong_8_296','make one’s acquaintance','','','结识；与……相见','I should be delighted to make Mrs McGough’s acquaintance.  我很高兴能认识麦高夫太太。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_8','PEPGaoZhong_8_297','handful','''hænd,fʊl','''hæn(d)fʊl; -f(ə)l','[n] 一把；几个人','The boy picked up a handful of stones and started throwing them at us.  那男孩捡起一把石子，开始朝我们扔过来。'),
