('PEPGaoZhong_8','PEPGaoZhong_8_299','in amazement','','','震惊；惊讶','They reacted with sighs of disappointment and stared in amazement at Hanna, who had more or less won the exchange.  他们都发出了失望的叹息，惊讶地盯着汉娜，她或多或少赢得了些理解。'),
