('PEPGaoZhong_8','PEPGaoZhong_8_304','superior','sʊˈpɪrɪɚ','suːˈpɪərɪə','[adj] 更好的；职位[级别]更高的；上级的; [n] 上级；长官','Fletcher’s superior technique brought him victory.  弗莱彻更胜一筹的技术使他取得了胜利。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_8','PEPGaoZhong_8_305','in terms of…','','','就……来说；从……角度','Our goods compete in terms of product quality, reliability and above all variety.  我们的产品从质量、可靠性、尤其是多样性来看很有竞争力。'),
