('PEPGaoZhong_8','PEPGaoZhong_8_346','alternative','ɔl''tɝnətɪv','ɔːl''tɜːnətɪv; ɒl-','[n] 可能的选择; [adj] 供选择的；其他的','If payment is not received legal action will be our only alternative .  如果收不到付款，我们只能采取法律行动。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_8','PEPGaoZhong_8_347','archaeology',',ɑrkɪ''ɑlədʒi',',ɑːkɪ''ɒlədʒɪ','[n] 考古学(<美>archeology)','He specializes in archaeology.  他专修考古学。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_8','PEPGaoZhong_8_348','archaeological','','','[adj] 考古学的；与考古学有关的 (<美>archeological)','So there are two other models, then, models different from the immigration model, two other models for understanding the formation of Israel, that build on this archaeological evidence.  那么还有两个其他的模型，与移民模型不同的两个模型，这两个模型也是为了说明以色列的形成，它们是依据考古学证据。'),
