('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_20','coincide',',koɪn''saɪd','ˌkəuɪn''saɪd','[vi] 同时发生； 一致','When our vacations coincided, we often holidayed together.  我们的假期要是凑巧赶在一起，我们常常会一同去度假。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_21','competent','''kɑmpɪtənt','''kɒmpɪtnt','[adj] 有能力的； 能胜任的','A competent mechanic should be able to fix the problem.  一名合格的机修工应该能够解决这个问题。'),
