('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_136','scrap','skræp','skræp','[n] 碎屑; [vt] 废弃； 抛弃','a rug made out of old scraps of material  用旧零碎材料拼做的一块小地毯'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_137','conjunction','kən''dʒʌŋkʃən','kən''dʒʌŋkʃn','[n] 连接； 连词',''),
