('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_140','roast','rost','rəust','[adj] 烤过的; [v] 烤， 炙; [n] 烤肉','roast chicken  烤鸡'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_141','succession','sək''sɛʃən','sək''seʃn','[n] 连续； 接替， 继承','She won the championship four times in succession.  她连续四次夺得冠军。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_142','haul','hɔl','hɔːl','[vt] 用力拖； 搬运','the steam locomotive which hauled the train  拖动火车的蒸汽机车'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_143','energetic',',ɛnɚ''dʒɛtɪk','ˌenə''dʒetɪk','[adj] 有力的， 精力旺盛的； 积极的','an energetic man  精力旺盛的男子'),
