('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_148','premier','prɪ''mɪr','''premiə(r)','[adj] 首要的， 第一位的； 最著名的; [n] 总理；首相','one of Dublin’s premier hotels  都柏林最好的酒店之一'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_149','hallowed','''hælod','''hæləud','[adj] 受崇敬的； 神圣的','The bones will be buried in hallowed ground.  尸骸将被安葬在神圣的土地上。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_150','intellectual',',ɪntə''lɛktʃuəl','ˌɪntə''lektʃuəl','[adj] 智力的； 理智的; [n] 知识分子','Mark’s very intellectual.  马克很聪明。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_151','reclaim','rɪ''klem','rɪ''kleɪm','[vt] 纠正； 要求归还， 收回； 开垦','You may be entitled to reclaim some tax.  你也许可以享受一定额度的退税。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_152','allergic','ə''lɝdʒɪk','ə''lɜːdʒɪk','[n] 过敏的， 变态反应的， 变应性的',''),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_153','cheat','tʃit','tʃiːt','[v] 欺骗；作弊; [n] 欺骗； 骗子','He had cheated in the test by using a calculator.  他在考试时作弊，用了计算器。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_154','disable','dɪs''ebl','dɪs''eɪbl','[vt] 使丧失能力， 使伤残； 使不能正常运转， 使无效','Carter was permanently disabled in the war.  卡特在那场战争中成了终生残废。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_155','undoubtedly','ʌn''daʊtɪdli','ˌʌn''dautɪdli','[adv] 毋庸置疑地， 确凿地',''),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_156','horrify','''hɔrə''fai','''hɒrɪfaɪ','[vt] 使恐惧， 使惊骇； 使震惊； 使感到厌恶','Henry was horrified by what had happened.  亨利对所发生的事感到毛骨悚然。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_157','anecdote','''ænɪkdot','''ænɪkdəut','[n] 短故事； 趣闻， 轶事','The book is full of amusing anecdotes about his life in Japan.  这本书里全是他在日本生活的趣闻轶事。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_158','extravagance','ɪk''strævəɡəns','ɪk''strævəgəns','[n] 奢侈， 挥霍； 放肆的言行','When the company went under, tales of his extravagance surged through the industry.  这家公司破产时，有关他的奢靡的传言传遍了整个业界。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_159','infiltrate','ɪn''fɪltret','''ɪnfɪltreɪt','[v] 悄悄进入， 潜入； 渗入， 渗透','Police attempts to infiltrate neo-Nazi groups were largely unsuccessful.  警方想打入新纳粹团体的行动基本上不成功。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_160','hostile','ˈhɑstl','''hɒstaɪl','[adj] 敌方的； 不友善的； 不利的','Southampton fans gave their former coach a hostile reception .  南安普敦队的球迷对球队的前任教练很不友善。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_161','fuel','''fjuəl','''fjʊːəl','[v] 给…加燃料; [n] 燃料','We’d better fuel up at the next town.  我们最好在下个小镇加油。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_162','flora','','''flɔːrə','[n] 一切植物， 植物群','Tourism is damaging the flora and fauna (= plants and animals ) of the island.  旅游业正在破坏该岛的动植物资源。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_163','celestial','sə''lɛstʃəl','sə''lestiəl','[adj] 天体的， 天上的','...the clusters of celestial bodies in the ever-expanding universe.  …不断扩展的宇宙中的这些天体群。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_164','crawl','krɔl','krɔːl','[vi] 爬，爬行；缓慢行进; [n] 缓慢的行进； 自由泳','We crawled into bed at 2 am.  我们凌晨两点爬上了床。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_165','identical','aɪ''dɛntɪkl','aɪ''dentɪkl','[adj] 完全相同的， 同一的','four identical houses  四幢一模一样的房子'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_166','lag','læɡ','læg','[v] 走得慢；落后; [n] 间隔； 滞后','Western banks still lag behind financial institutions in most other regions of the country.  西部地区的银行仍然落后于这个国家其他大部分地区的金融机构。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_167','ambitious','æm''bɪʃəs','æm''bɪʃəs','[adj] 有抱负的， 有雄心的， 有野心的','Alfred was intensely ambitious, obsessed with the idea of becoming rich.  艾尔弗雷德雄心勃勃，一心想着发财。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_168','academic',',ækə''dɛmɪk','ˌækə''demɪk','[adj] 学院的；学术的；不切实际的; [n] 学者； 大学教师','He possessed no academic qualifications.  他没有学历。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_169','coral','''kɔrəl','''kɒrəl','[adj] 珊瑚色的， 红色的; [n] 珊瑚；珊瑚虫','It is like the bow of the King of the Persians that is painted with vermilion and is tipped with coral.  你的嘴唇就像是波斯王国的弯弓，那是一张涂上朱砂的弯弓，那是一张头上镶嵌珊瑚的弯弓。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_170','function','''fʌŋkʃən','''fʌŋkʃn','[vi] 运行，起作用; [n] 功能； 职责， 作用； 函数','Her legs have now ceased to function .  她的双腿现在已经丧失正常功能了。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_171','delinquency','dɪ''lɪŋkwənsi','dɪ''lɪŋkwənsi','[n] 失职； 行为不良','the ever-rising statistics of delinquency and crime  青少年违法犯罪不断增加的统计数字'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_172','representative','''rɛprɪ''zɛntətɪv','ˌreprɪ''zentətɪv','[adj] 典型的， 有代表性的; [n] 代表，代理人','The pollsters asked a representative sample of New York residents for their opinions.  民意调查员向一些有代表性的纽约居民征询了意见。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_173','longitude','''lɑndʒətud','''lɒndʒɪtjuːd','[n] 经度， 经线','The town lies at longitude 12˚ east.  这个镇位于东经12度。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_174','lax','læks','læks','[adj] 懒散的； 松弛的， 不严格的， 马虎的','One of the problem areas is lax security for airport personnel.  其中一个问题是对机场人员的安全措施不严格。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_175','comparison','kəm''pærɪsn','kəm''pærɪsn','[n] 比较， 对比， 对照； 比喻， 比拟','Her paintings invite comparison with those of the early Impressionists (= they remind you of them ) .  她的画作让人想起早期的印象派作品。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_176','hatch','hætʃ','hætʃ','[v] 孵出，孵化；策划; [n] 开口； 舱门','The eggs take three days to hatch.  这些蛋要三天时间才能孵化。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_177','pardon','''pɑrdn','''pɑːdn','[interjection] 请重复一遍，请再说一遍〔没听清对方的话希望重复一遍时的用语〕; [v] 赦免; [n] 赦免令，赦免状','‘Hurry up Jonathan!’ ‘Pardon?’ ‘I said hurry up!’  “快点，乔纳森！”“你说什么啊？”“我说快点！”'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_178','herbivore','ɝ​bəˌvɔr','''hɜːbɪvɔː(r)','[n] 食草动物','Most herbivore teeth are grinders, canines are usually absent.  食草动物的牙齿大部分是臼齿，通常没有犬齿。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_179','adventure','əd''vɛntʃɚ','əd''ventʃə(r)','[n] 冒险， 冒险活动； 异乎寻常的经历， 奇遇','a great adventure  一大奇遇'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_180','successive','sək''sɛsɪv','sək''sesɪv','[adj] 连续的','The team has had five successive victories.  这支球队已经连胜五场了。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_181','condition','kən''dɪʃən','kən''dɪʃn','[n] 状况，状态；; [vt] 训练； 使适应， 使习惯于； 对…有重要影响','Profits increased by £1.5m, despite the difficult economic conditions.  尽管经济形势不佳，利润还是增长了150万英镑。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_182','thirsty','''θɝsti','''θɜːsti','[adj] 口渴的； 饥渴的','Can I have a glass of water? I’m really thirsty.  我能喝一杯水吗？ 我太渴了。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_183','ceremony','ˈsɛrəˌmoʊni','''serəmənɪ','[n] 典礼； 仪式','a wedding ceremony  婚礼'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_184','improve','ɪm''pruv','ɪm''pruːv','[v] 改善， 改进','a course for students wishing to improve their English  为想提高英语水平的学生开设的一门课'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_185','obligation',',ɑblɪ''ɡeʃən','ˌɒblɪ''geɪʃn','[n] 义务， 职责， 责任','Employers have an obligation to treat all employees equally.  雇主有责任对所有员工一视同仁。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_186','vice versa',',vaisi''və:sə',',vaisi''və:sə','[adv] 反过来也是如此，反之亦然','The boys may refuse to play with the girls, and vice versa.  男孩可能拒绝和女孩玩耍，反之亦然。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_187','hawk','hɔk','hɔːk','[n] 鹰， 隼','She watched his every move like a hawk.  她像鹰一样注视着他的每一个动作。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_188','rarity','''rɛrəti','''reərəti','[n] 稀有； 稀有的事物','Some of these plants are national rarities.  这些植物中有些是国家珍品。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_189','patriotic','ˌpetrɪˈɑtɪk','ˌpætri''ɒtɪk;ˌpeɪtri''ɒtɪk','[adj] 爱国的， 有爱国心的； 显示出爱国精神的','patriotic songs  爱国歌曲'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_190','lavatory','''lævətɔri','''lævətrɪ','[n] 盥洗室， 厕所','...the ladies'' lavatory.  …女厕所。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_191','exterior','ɪk''stɪrɪɚ','ɪk''stɪərɪə(r)','[adj] 外部的，外表的; [n] 外部， 外表','The exterior walls need a new coat of paint.  外墙需要刷新漆了。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_192','censure','''sɛnʃɚ','''senʃə(r)','[vt&n] 指责， 谴责， 责难','The ethics committee may take a decision to admonish him or to censure him.  道德规范委员会可能决定对他进行警告或批评。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_193','airtight','''ɛrtaɪt','''eətaɪt','[adj] 密闭的； 无懈可击的','airtight containers  密封容器'),
