('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_538','ferry','''fɛri','''feri','[v] 渡运; [n] 渡船；摆渡','Every day, a plane arrives to ferry guests to and from Bird Island Lodge.  每天，一架飞机到达以运送进出鸟岛宾馆的客人。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_539','acclimatise','ə''klaimətaiz','ə''klaɪmətaɪz','[v] 服水土； 适应新环境','This year he has left for St Louis early to acclimatise himself.  今年他早早地前往圣路易斯以便适应新环境。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_540','ignore','ɪɡ''nɔr','ɪg''nɔː(r)','[vt] 不顾， 不理， 忽视','You can’t ignore the fact that many criminals never go to prison.  你不能无视很多罪犯从未获刑的事实。'),
