('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_542','nuclear','''nuklɪɚ','''njuːklɪə(r)','[adj] 核能的， 原子能的','France’s reliance on nuclear energy  法国对核能的依赖'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_543','applaud','ə''plɔd','ə''plɔːd','[v] 鼓掌， 喝彩； 称赞','The audience applauded loudly.  观众掌声雷动。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_544','lunar','''lunɚ','''luːnə(r)','[adj] 月的； 月亮的','studies of the lunar surface  对月球表面的研究'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_545','relax','rɪ''læks','rɪ''læks','[v] 放松','I just want to sit down and relax.  我只想坐下来休息一下。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_546','relay','rɪ''le','''riːleɪ','[n] 接力赛；中继设备[''riːleI;ri''leI]; [vt] 传送； 转播','the 100 metres relay  一百米接力赛'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_547','abode','ə''bod','ə''bəud','[n] 房屋， 家， 住所','Welcome to my humble abode.  欢迎光临寒舍。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_548','permission','pɚ''mɪʃən','pə''mɪʃn','[n] 允许， 准许','He asked permission to leave the room.  他请求离开房间的许可。'),
