('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_553','deterioration','dɪ,tɪrɪə''reʃən','dɪˌtɪərə''reɪʃn','[n] 恶化； 堕落','Underneath the siding is a "splash base" to further prevent deterioration.  在壁板下面是一个“飞溅基础”，以进一步防止恶化。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_554','interpret','ɪn''tɝprɪt','ɪn''tɜːprɪt','[v] 解释， 说明； 口译， 翻译','They spoke good Spanish, and promised to interpret for me.  他们西班牙语说得很好，答应替我翻译。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_555','universe','''junɪvɝs','''juːnɪvɜːs','[n] 宇宙， 天地万物； 世界； 领域','Einstein''s equations showed the universe to be expanding.  爱因斯坦的方程式表明宇宙正在扩大。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_556','blanket','''blæŋkɪt','''blæŋkɪt','[n] 毯子； 厚的覆盖物','The mud disappeared under a blanket of snow.  泥地在一层白雪的覆盖下消失不见了。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_557','grant','ɡrænt','grɑːnt','[v] 同意， 承认； 给予， 授予; [n] 授予物；补助金，助学金，津贴；授权','Britain could grant Spain’s request .  英国可能会同意西班牙的请求。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_558','newsletter','''nuzlɛtɚ','''njuːzletə(r)','[n] 时事通讯， 业务通讯','The society publishes a newsletter twice a year.  该社团一年出版两次简报。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_559','conductive','kən''dʌktɪv','kən''dʌktɪv','[adj] 能传导电的， 导电的','Copper is a very conductive metal.  铜是一种传导性极强的金属。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_560','discount','dɪs''kaʊnt','''dɪskaʊnt','[n] 折扣; [vt] 给…打折； 漠视， 低估','They are often available at a discount.  它们经常可以以折扣价买到。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_561','construct','kən''strʌkt','kən''strʌkt','[vt] 建造；构思，构筑；创立[''kɒnstrʌkt]; [n] 构想， 观念','There are plans to construct a new road bridge across the river.  有计划要建造一条新的跨河公路桥。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_562','convert','kən''vɝt','kən''vɜːt','[v] 改变信仰， 皈依； 转变， 转化； 改装','The signal will be converted into digital code.  信号将被转变成数字编码。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_563','attempt','ə''tɛmpt','ə''tempt','[n&v] 尝试， 试图； 努力','Weather conditions prevented them from attempting the jump.  天气状况使他们无法尝试跳伞。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_564','division','də''vɪʒən','dɪ''vɪʒn','[n] 分开， 分隔； 分配； 分歧； 除； 部门， 科， 司','the traditional division of labour (= the way that particular tasks are shared ) between husband and wife  夫妻之间传统的分工'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_565','navigation','''nævə''geʃən','ˌnævɪ''geɪʃn','[n] 航空， 航海， 航行； 导航， 领航','compasses and other instruments of navigation  罗盘及其他导航仪器'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_566','stale','stel','steɪl','[adj] 不新鲜的； 陈腐的','French bread goes stale (= becomes stale ) very quickly.  法式面包极易变味。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_567','balance','''bæləns','''bæləns','[n] 平衡；余额; [vt] 平衡','I lost my balance and fell on my face.  我失去平衡，脸着地摔倒了。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_568','fingerprint','''fɪŋɡɚprɪnt','''fɪŋgəprɪnt','[n] 指纹， 手印','His fingerprints were all over the gun.  枪上到处是他的指纹。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_569','pitch','pɪtʃ','pɪtʃ','[v] 投掷；颠簸；为…定音高; [n] 沥青； 场地； 程度； 最高点； 音高','She crumpled up the page and pitched it into the fire.  她把那页纸揉成团，扔进了火里。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_570','whereas','''wɛr''æz','ˌweər''æz','[conj] 然而， 但是','The old system was fairly complicated whereas the new system is really very simple.  旧系统相当复杂，而新系统却很简单。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_571','torrent','''tɔrənt','''tɒrənt','[n] 洪流； 爆发； 连发','Torrents of water gushed into the reservoir.  急流涌进了水库。'),
