('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_576','brew','brʊ','bruː','[v] 酿造； 冲泡； 酝酿','Every beer on the menu was brewed locally.  酒单上的所有啤酒都是本地酿造的。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_577','curry','''kɝi','''kʌri','[n] 咖喱，','chicken curry  咖喱鸡'),
