('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_863','offset',',ɔf''sɛt','''ɒfset','[vt] 抵消， 补偿， 弥补','Cuts in food prices will be offset by direct payments to farmers.  食品降价将通过直接付款给农民的方式进行补偿。'),
