('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1202','vested','''vɛstɪd','''vestɪd','[adj] 法律规定的； 既定的','Shareholders have a vested right to 10% per annum.  股东享有每年10%分红的既定权利。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1203','conclusion','kən''kluʒn','kən''kluːʒn','[n] 结论， 推论； 结束， 结尾； 【法】 缔结， 议定','These are the report’s main conclusions.  这些就是这篇报告的主要结论。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1204','durable','''dʊrəbl','''djuərəbl','[adj] 耐用的','Wood is a durable material.  木头是耐用材料。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1205','impose','ɪm''poz','ɪm''pəuz','[v] 把…强加于； 征； 处以','Parents should beware of imposing their own tastes on their children.  父母应该提防把自己的兴趣强加给孩子。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1206','mammal','''mæml','''mæml','[n] 哺乳动物','The more you follow the fear, the more you live like a lower mammal.  你越是追随恐惧行为，就越会活得像个低级哺乳动物。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1207','condensation',',kɑndɛn''seʃən','ˌkɒnden''seɪʃn','[n] 浓缩， 凝结','He used his sleeve to wipe the condensation off the glass.  他用袖子擦去眼镜上凝结的水滴。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1208','statement','''stetmənt','''steɪtmənt','[n] 陈述； 声明； 报表','In an official statement, she formally announced her resignation.  在一份官方声明中，她正式宣布辞职。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1209','delivery','dɪ''lɪvəri','dɪ''lɪvəri','[n] 投递， 交付； 分娩','Most Indian restaurants offer free delivery.  大多数印度餐馆提供免费外送服务。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1210','conquer','''kɑŋkɚ','''kɒŋkə(r)','[vt] 征服， 战胜， 占领； 克服， 破除','The Normans conquered England in 1066.  诺曼人于 1066 年征服英格兰。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1211','continuity','''kɑntə''nʊəti','ˌkɒntɪ''njuːəti','[n] 连续； 持续','We should ensure continuity of care between hospital and home.  我们应当保证医院护理和家庭护理的连续性。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1212','sculpture','''skʌlptʃɚ','''skʌlptʃə(r)','[n] 雕塑品','...stone sculptures of figures and animals.  …人物及动物石雕。'),
