('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1219','departmental',',dipɑrt''mɛntl','ˌdiːpɑːt''mentl','[adj] 部门的','The Secretary of Education is right to seek a bigger departmental budget.  教育部长寻求更多的部门预算是对的。'),
