('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1221','melatonin',',mɛlə''tonɪn','ˌmelə''təunɪn','[n] 褪黑激素','Sunlight can refrain the growth of melatonin in the body.  阳光能抑制身体中褪黑激素的生长。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1222','discard','dɪsˈkɑːrd','dɪs''kɑːd','[vt] 丢弃， 遗弃','Read the manufacturer''s guidelines before discarding the box.  先阅读制造商的说明书再把盒子丢掉。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1223','subsidy','''sʌbsədi','''sʌbsədi','[n] 津贴， 补助金','European farmers are planning a massive demonstration against farm subsidy cuts.  欧洲的农场主们正在策划一场反对削减农场补贴的大游行。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1224','obscene','əb''sin','əb''siːn','[adj] 淫秽的， 猥亵的， 下流的； 可憎的， 可恶的； 大得惊人的， 骇人听闻的','Bradford made an obscene gesture.  布拉德福德做了个下流手势。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1225','prohibitive','prə''hɪbətɪv','prə''hɪbətɪv','[adj] 禁止的， 抑制的； 令人望而却步的','The cost of land in Tokyo is prohibitive.  东京地价令人望而却步。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1226','attentive','ə''tɛntɪv','ə''tentɪv','[adj] 注意的， 专心的； 关心的， 体贴的； 留意的','an attentive audience  聚精会神的听众'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1227','merchandising','''mɝtʃəndaɪzɪŋ','''mɜːtʃəndaɪzɪŋ','[n] 销售规划','Company executives say revamped merchandising should help Macy''s earnings to grow.  公司主管说改进后的销售规划应该能帮助梅西公司提高收益。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1228','moribund','''mɔrɪbʌnd','''mɒrɪbʌnd','[adj] 垂死的， 即将灭亡的； 即将结束的','The patient was moribund by the time the doctor arrived.  医生赶到的时候病人已经奄奄一息。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1229','crush','krʌʃ','krʌʃ','[vt] 碾碎； 压服， 压垮； 镇压， 制服； 压碎， 压坏','His leg was crushed in the accident.  他的腿在事故中被压断。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1230','embed','ɪm''bɛd','ɪm''bed','[vt] 把…嵌入， 扎牢； 使深留脑中','Feelings of guilt are deeply embedded in her personality.  负罪感在她的性格里根深蒂固。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1231','promising','''prɑmɪsɪŋ','''prɒmɪsɪŋ','[adj] 有希望的； 有前途的','a promising career in law  很有前途的法律职业'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1232','counsel','''kaʊnsl','''kaunsl','[v] 商议， 劝告; [n] 律师，法律顾问；建议，忠告','My advisers counselled me to do nothing.  我的顾问建议我不要做任何事情。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1233','liver','''lɪvɚ','''lɪvə(r)','[n] 生活者， 居住者； 肝脏','Three weeks ago, it was discovered the cancer had spread to his liver.  三周前，发现癌已扩散到了他的肝脏。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1234','probability','''prɑbə''bɪləti','ˌprɒbə''bɪləti','[n] 可能性； 概率','You must decide whether, on the balance of probabilities , he committed the crime.  你们一定要权衡正反两方面的可能性，然后再裁定他是否犯罪。'),
