('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1266','stuff','stʌf','stʌf','[n] 原料，材料; [vt] 填进； 让…吃饱','I stuffed my hands in my pockets.  我把双手塞进了我的口袋里。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1267','offspring','''ɔfsprɪŋ','''ɒfsprɪŋ','[n] 子女， 后代； 产物','a young mother trying to control her offspring  一个想管住自己孩子的年轻妈妈'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1268','section','''sɛkʃən','''sekʃn','[n] 部分； 部门； 截面','The plane’s tail section was found in a cornfield.  飞机的尾部在玉米田里找到了。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1269','constantly','''kɑnstəntli','''kɒnstəntli','[adv] 经常； 不断地','He talked constantly about his work.  他不断地谈到他的工作。'),
