('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1563','intelligent','ɪn''tɛlɪdʒənt','ɪn''telɪdʒənt','[adj] 聪明的， 理智的','a group of highly intelligent (= very intelligent )students  一组聪明异常的学生'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1564','equip','ɪ''kwɪp','ɪ''kwɪp','[vt] 装备， 配备； 使有能力， 使有准备','They try to equip their vehicles with gadgets to deal with every possible contingency.  他们尽量给他们的车辆配备各种小装置以应付任何可能的突发状况。'),
