('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1570','convenience','kən''vinɪəns','kən''viːnɪəns','[n] 方便； 便利设施','Ready meals sell well because of their convenience.  即食餐因为方便销路好。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1571','discipline','''dɪsəplɪn','''dɪsəplɪn','[vt] 训练，','Different cultures have different ways of disciplining their children.  不同的文化有不同的管教孩子的方法。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1572','emission','ɪ''mɪʃən','i''mɪʃn','[n] 散发； 散发物','Britain agreed to cut emissions of nitrogen oxide from power stations.  英国同意减少发电站氮氧化物的排放量。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1573','estimate','''ɛstə,met','''estɪmeɪt','[v] 估计，估量；估价；评价[''estImət]; [n] 估计， 估量； 估价； 评价','Try to estimate how many steps it will take to get to a close object.  估计一下需要多少步才能到达一个近距目标。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1574','check-up','''tʃekʌp','''tʃekʌp','[n] 检查','I went to the hospital for a check-up this morning.  今天早上我到医院去做了一次检查。'),
