('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1577','brand','brænd','brænd','[n] 商标；品牌; [vt] 铭刻， 打烙印于； 丑化','products which lack a strong brand image  缺乏鲜明品牌形象的产品'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1578','proposal','prə''pozl','prə''pəuzl','[n] 提议， 建议； 求婚','The president is to put forward new proposals for resolving the country''s constitutional crisis.  总统将提出解决国家宪法危机的新议案。'),
