('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1581','frustration','frʌ''streʃən','frʌ''streɪʃn','[n] 沮丧， 不满','People often feel a sense of frustration that they are not being promoted quickly enough.  人们经常有一种挫折感，就是觉得自己升职不够快。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1582','recreation',',rɛkrɪ''eʃən','ˌrekri''eɪʃn','[n] 娱乐， 消遣','His only recreations are drinking beer and watching football.  他唯一的消遣就是喝啤酒和看足球比赛。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1583','skyscraper','''skaɪ''skrepɚ','''skaɪskreɪpə(r)','[n] 摩天楼','With a few exceptions, the technique for building a skyscraper is similar whether you are in Europe or you are in Singapore.  除了少数特例外，不管是在欧洲还是新加坡，建造一幢摩天楼的技术大体上是相似的。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1584','allowance','ə''laʊəns','ə''lauəns','[n] 津贴； 允许， 容忍','She gets an allowance for taking care of Amy.  她照顾艾米是有津贴的。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1585','portable','''pɔrtəbl','''pɔːtəbl','[adj] 便于携带的； 手提式的','a portable radio  便携式收音机'),
