('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1594','conference','''kɑnfərəns','''kɒnfərəns','[n] 会议','Representatives from over 100 countries attended the International Peace Conference in Geneva.  来自一百多个国家的代表出席了在日内瓦举行的国际和平大会。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1595','knob','nɑb','nɒb','[n] 球形把手； 旋钮','He thought the door was locked, but he turned the knob and the door opened.  他本以为门是锁住的，但是转了一下把手门就开了。'),
