('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1600','lecture','''lɛktʃɚ','''lektʃə(r)','[n] 演讲， 讲课','...a series of lectures by Professor Eric Robinson.  …埃里克·鲁滨逊教授的系列讲座。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1601','persist','pɚ''sɪst','pə''sɪst','[vi] 坚持； 维持， 保持， 持续','‘I don’t think it’s right,’ John persisted.  “我认为那不对。”约翰坚持说道。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1602','pump','pʌmp','pʌmp','[v] 用泵抽；涌出，奔流; [n] 泵， 抽水机','We were able to pump clean water from several of the wells.  我们能从几口井里抽出干净的水来。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1603','caution','''kɔʃən','''kɔːʃn','[v] 提醒， 警告; [n] 谨慎，小心','Tony cautioned against misrepresenting the situation.  托尼告诫说不要歪曲事实。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1604','apart','ə''pɑrt','ə''pɑːt','[adv] 相间隔；分离；除去; [adj] 分离的','They have offices in countries as far apart as India and Peru.  他们的办事处远至印度、秘鲁等国。'),
('IELTS_3','IELTS_3_1605','calendar','''kæləndɚ','''kælɪndə(r)','[n] 日历； 月历； 日程表','There was a calendar on the wall above, with large squares around the dates.  墙的上方曾有一本日历，日期框在大方格里。'),
